Fundamentalist Agents, by David Arias.

Started on 2026-09-30 from LangChain's data-enrichment LangGraph template
(https://github.com/langchain-ai/data-enrichment, MIT License, see LICENSE-langchain-template).
The template's agent loop is kept; its web tools, prompts and LLM checker were replaced by a search
over SEC filings, evidence prompts, turn and search limits, a token ledger and a code verifier.
The EDGAR functions are adapted from the author's own jev-for-finance/jev_rag.py.
